#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Endpoint | Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `GET /v1/jobs`, `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics` | `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/workloads` | `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
"| `POST /v1/sessions`, `GET /v1/sessions/{id}` | `elapsed_time` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/instances/usage` | `usage_consumed_seconds`, `usage_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru`, `usage_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/accounts/{id}` | `plans[].usage_limit_seconds`, `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru`, `plans[].usage_allocation_ru`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
"| Resource Controller API: Create, update, and read service instances | `instance_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date` | Each usage field in milliseconds | The matching field with the `_ru` suffix |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Endpoint | Da ignorare | Da leggere invece |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `GET /v1/jobs`, `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics` | `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/workloads` | `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
"| `POST /v1/sessions`, `GET /v1/sessions/{id}` | `elapsed_time` | `usage.value` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/instances/usage` | `usage_consumed_seconds`, `usage_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru`, `usage_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/accounts/{id}` | `plans[].usage_limit_seconds`, `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru`, `plans[].usage_allocation_ru`, `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
"| Resource Controller API: creazione, aggiornamento e lettura delle istanze del servizio | `instance_limit_seconds`, `usage_allocation_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru`, `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date` | Ogni campo di utilizzo in millisecondi | Il campo corrispondente con il suffisso `_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The sections that follow give the details for each endpoint.\n"
msgstr "Le sezioni seguenti forniscono i dettagli per ogni endpoint.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Jobs {#jobs}"
msgstr "Job {#jobs}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `GET /v1/jobs` and `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/jobs` e `GET /v1/jobs/{id}/metrics`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Da ignorare | Da leggere invece |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `usage` object also has these fields:\n"
msgstr "L'oggetto `usage` contiene anche questi campi:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.unit`: The unit of `usage.value`. The value is always `\"resource_units\"`.\n"
msgstr "`usage.unit`: l'unità di `usage.value`. Il valore è sempre `\"resource_units\"`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.status`: The billing status. The value is `\"pending\"` or `\"complete\"`. If the status is `\"pending\"`, the platform can still change the value. Do not use a pending value as the final usage.\n"
msgstr "`usage.status`: lo stato di fatturazione. Il valore è `\"pending\"` o `\"complete\"`. Se lo stato è `\"pending\"`, la piattaforma può ancora modificare il valore. Non usare un valore in sospeso come utilizzo finale.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[]`: The usage for each billing metric. The `value` of each entry is in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[]`: l'utilizzo per ogni metrica di fatturazione. Il `value` di ogni voce è in RU.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example:\n"
msgstr "Example:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The field `usage.details[].metric.value` is not the usage in RUs. It is the quantity of the metric that the platform used to calculate the RUs. Each metric has its own unit. For example, the unit of a QPU metric is seconds. For the usage, read `usage.details[].value`.\n"
msgstr "Il campo `usage.details[].metric.value` non è l'utilizzo in RU. È la quantità della metrica che la piattaforma ha usato per calcolare le RU. Ogni metrica ha la propria unità. Ad esempio, l'unità di una metrica QPU è il secondo. Per l'utilizzo, leggi `usage.details[].value`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workloads {#workloads}"
msgstr "Carichi di lavoro {#workloads}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/workloads`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/workloads`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each item in `workloads[]` has a `usage` object. This object has the same fields as the `usage` object of a job.\n"
msgstr "Ogni elemento di `workloads[]` ha un oggetto `usage`. Questo oggetto ha gli stessi campi dell'oggetto `usage` di un job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Da ignorare | Da leggere invece |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `workloads[].usage.qpu_charge_time_seconds` | `workloads[].usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If a workload is still running, `usage` is `null`.\n"
msgstr "Se un carico di lavoro è ancora in esecuzione, `usage` è `null`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function workloads {#function-workloads}"
msgstr "Carichi di lavoro di function {#function-workloads}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The usage of a function workload is in RUs, the same as for a QPU workload. A function workload can use more than one metric:\n"
msgstr "L'utilizzo di un carico di lavoro di function è in RU, come per un carico di lavoro QPU. Un carico di lavoro di function può usare più di una metrica:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**QPU usage.** This is metered per second of quantum time. See [Execution modes](/guides/execution-modes).\n"
msgstr "**Utilizzo della QPU.** Viene misurato per secondo di tempo quantistico. Vedi [Modalità di esecuzione](/guides/execution-modes).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Classical compute usage.** This is metered per second of [classical time](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"
msgstr "**Utilizzo del calcolo classico.** Viene misurato per secondo di [tempo classico](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Execution license cost.** This is metered per workload, based on the [size of the problem passed to a function](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions).\n"
msgstr "**Costo della licenza di esecuzione.** Viene misurato per carico di lavoro, in base alla [dimensione del problema passato a una function](/guides/functions#overview-of-available-functions).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The platform converts the quantity of each metric to RUs. Thus, all usage values are in RUs:\n"
msgstr "La piattaforma converte la quantità di ogni metrica in RU. Quindi tutti i valori di utilizzo sono in RU:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.value` is the usage of the workload, in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.value` è l'utilizzo del carico di lavoro, in RU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[].value` is the usage for one metric, in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[].value` è l'utilizzo per una metrica, in RU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`usage.details[].metric.value` is the quantity of the metric, in the unit of that metric. It is not in RUs.\n"
msgstr "`usage.details[].metric.value` è la quantità della metrica, nell'unità di quella metrica. Non è in RU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you show or add usage values, use `usage.value` and `usage.details[].value`. Do not use `usage.details[].metric.value`.\n"
msgstr "Se mostri o sommi valori di utilizzo, usa `usage.value` e `usage.details[].value`. Non usare `usage.details[].metric.value`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sessions {#sessions}"
msgstr "Sessioni {#sessions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `POST /v1/sessions` and `GET /v1/sessions/{id}`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `POST /v1/sessions` e `GET /v1/sessions/{id}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `elapsed_time` (seconds) | `usage.value` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Da ignorare | Da leggere invece |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `elapsed_time` (secondi) | `usage.value` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The session `usage` object has `unit` and `details[]`. These fields work the same as in the job `usage` object, with the exception of the `status` field, which is omitted for sessions.\n"
msgstr "L'oggetto `usage` della sessione ha `unit` e `details[]`. Questi campi funzionano come nell'oggetto `usage` del job, con l'eccezione del campo `status`, che è omesso per le sessioni.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl`, and `active_ttl` do not change. They are time limits (TTL means \"time to live\"), not usage. Their unit stays seconds.\n"
msgstr "I campi `interactive_ttl`, `max_ttl` e `active_ttl` non cambiano. Sono limiti di tempo (TTL significa \"time to live\"), non utilizzo. La loro unità resta il secondo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance usage {#instance-usage}"
msgstr "Utilizzo dell'istanza {#instance-usage}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/instances/usage`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/instances/usage`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage_consumed_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_limit_seconds` | `usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Da ignorare | Da leggere invece |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage_consumed_seconds` | `usage_consumed_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_limit_seconds` | `usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fields `usage_limit_reached`, `usage_period`, and `time_available_at` do not change.\n"
msgstr "I campi `usage_limit_reached`, `usage_period` e `time_available_at` non cambiano.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Account plans {#account-plans}"
msgstr "Piani dell'account {#account-plans}"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoint: `GET /v1/accounts/{id}`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/accounts/{id}`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each item in `plans[]` has these changes:\n"
msgstr "Ogni elemento di `plans[]` ha queste modifiche:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard | Read instead |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_limit_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds` | `plans[].usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Da ignorare | Da leggere invece |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_limit_seconds` | `plans[].usage_limit_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].usage_allocation_seconds` | `plans[].usage_allocation_ru` |\n"
"| `plans[].unallocated_usage_seconds` | `plans[].unallocated_usage_ru` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Service instances in the Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"
msgstr "Istanze del servizio nella Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API is a separate API. You use it to create and update service instances. If you create or update instances with this API, change the instance parameters too.\n"
msgstr "La IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API è un'API separata. La usi per creare e aggiornare le istanze del servizio. Se crei o aggiorni istanze con questa API, modifica anche i parametri dell'istanza.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you create or update an instance, send these parameters in the request:\n"
msgstr "Quando crei o aggiorni un'istanza, invia questi parametri nella richiesta:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Don't send | Send instead | Type of the new parameter |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Non inviare | Invia invece | Tipo del nuovo parametro |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Numero o `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Numero o `null` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The parameters have these meanings:\n"
msgstr "I parametri hanno questi significati:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Instance limit**The maximum usage for the instance. If you do not send a limit on the Open Plan, the default is the RU equivalent of 10 minutes.\n"
msgstr "**Limite dell'istanza**: l'utilizzo massimo per l'istanza. Se non invii un limite nell'Open Plan, il valore predefinito è l'equivalente in RU di 10 minuti.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Usage allocation**: The share of usage for the instance. The fair-share scheduler uses this value to set the priority of the instance in the queue. The allocation does not apply to Pay-As-You-Go instances.\n"
msgstr "**Allocazione di utilizzo**: la quota di utilizzo per l'istanza. Lo scheduler fair-share usa questo valore per impostare la priorità dell'istanza nella coda. L'allocazione non si applica alle istanze Pay-As-You-Go.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you read an instance, the `extensions` object in the response contains the old fields and the new fields. Disregard `instance_limit_seconds` and `usage_allocation_seconds`. Read `instance_limit_ru` and `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"
msgstr "Quando leggi un'istanza, l'oggetto `extensions` nella risposta contiene sia i vecchi campi sia i nuovi campi. Ignora `instance_limit_seconds` e `usage_allocation_seconds`. Leggi `instance_limit_ru` e `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more information, see the [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"
msgstr "Per ulteriori informazioni, consulta la [documentazione della REST API di IBM Quantum Compute Service](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage analytics {#usage-analytics}"
msgstr "Analisi dell'utilizzo {#usage-analytics}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, and `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoint: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped` e `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The three endpoints have the same usage fields. The two grouped endpoints return these fields for each group or each date.\n"
msgstr "I tre endpoint hanno gli stessi campi di utilizzo. I due endpoint raggruppati restituiscono questi campi per ogni gruppo o per ogni data.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
